L["A courier brought word of Thas'dorah — the ancestral bow of the Windrunner family, carried by Alleria into the Twisting Nether and lost for decades. You followed the trail through ancient elven ruins, fighting off demons who sought to claim its power. The bow sang in your hands when you drew it, as if it had been waiting for a worthy archer all along."] = "A courier brought word of Thas'dorah — the ancestral bow of the Windrunner family, carried by Alleria into the Twisting Nether and lost for decades. You followed the trail through ancient elven ruins, fighting off demons who sought to claim its power. The bow sang in your hands when you drew it, as if it had been waiting for a worthy archer all along."
