L["At the Maelstrom's edge, the Earthen Ring struggles to keep Azeroth from tearing apart. The elements are restless, wounded, and not always willing to answer.\n\nAs Farseer, seek the elemental lords, restore balance where the world is breaking, and hold the center while the Legion tries to pull everything apart."] = "At the Maelstrom's edge, the Earthen Ring struggles to keep Azeroth from tearing apart. The elements are restless, wounded, and not always willing to answer.\n\nAs Farseer, seek the elemental lords, restore balance where the world is breaking, and hold the center while the Legion tries to pull everything apart."
L["At the northern edge of the forest, a wounded sprite led you into an older, stranger grief. The mogu had bound spirits into vessels, rituals, and stone. Pei-Zhi needed those cycles broken before the dead were consumed by someone else's ambition. You shattered simulacrums, gathered ritual artifacts, released wayward spirits, returned beasts to nature, and offered the humility the terrace demanded. To bridge earth and sky, you had to answer the past without trying to own it."] = "At the northern edge of the forest, a wounded sprite led you into an older, stranger grief. The mogu had bound spirits into vessels, rituals, and stone. Pei-Zhi needed those cycles broken before the dead were consumed by someone else's ambition. You shattered simulacrums, gathered ritual artifacts, released wayward spirits, returned beasts to nature, and offered the humility the terrace demanded. To bridge earth and sky, you had to answer the past without trying to own it."
