L["Belath's intelligence pointed to a Legion commander hiding in Stormheim. Malace Shade tracked the demon through vrykul lands while you disrupted their rune networks. The trail led to Niskara — a demon world that could only be reached by jumping the Fel Hammer through a portal. You forged deadlier warglaives, fueled the ship's engines with demonic power, and launched the invasion. On Niskara, you cut through the Legion's defenses, destroyed their command structure, and earned the title of Slayer — the demon hunters' highest honor."] = "Belath's intelligence pointed to a Legion commander hiding in Stormheim. Malace Shade tracked the demon through vrykul lands while you disrupted their rune networks. The trail led to Niskara — a demon world that could only be reached by jumping the Fel Hammer through a portal. You forged deadlier warglaives, fueled the ship's engines with demonic power, and launched the invasion. On Niskara, you cut through the Legion's defenses, destroyed their command structure, and earned the title of Slayer — the demon hunters' highest honor."
