L["Follow old friends across Pandaria, retracing the journey that shaped the Wandering Isle and the pandaren who left it behind. The mists have lifted, the war has moved on, and a new generation needs to understand what its elders carried into exile.\n\nWalk the slopes of Kun-Lai, sit at the brewmaster's hearth in the Valley of the Four Winds, and listen to stories the rest of the world has only just begun to hear."] = "Follow old friends across Pandaria, retracing the journey that shaped the Wandering Isle and the pandaren who left it behind. The mists have lifted, the war has moved on, and a new generation needs to understand what its elders carried into exile.\n\nWalk the slopes of Kun-Lai, sit at the brewmaster's hearth in the Valley of the Four Winds, and listen to stories the rest of the world has only just begun to hear."
