L["Gakin the Darkbinder dispatched troops while Ritssyn uncovered troubling archives — bloodstones were appearing across the Broken Isles, corrupting the land with fel energy. You traveled to Azsuna where Kira Iresoul was already investigating. Together you traced the bloodstone bandits to their source, tested a theory on the stones' hunger for blood, and repaid the debt with fire. Jubeka Shadowbreaker and Zinnin Smythe joined the Council as champions. A daring rescue followed — the Council looked after its own."] = "Gakin the Darkbinder dispatched troops while Ritssyn uncovered troubling archives — bloodstones were appearing across the Broken Isles, corrupting the land with fel energy. You traveled to Azsuna where Kira Iresoul was already investigating. Together you traced the bloodstone bandits to their source, tested a theory on the stones' hunger for blood, and repaid the debt with fire. Jubeka Shadowbreaker and Zinnin Smythe joined the Council as champions. A daring rescue followed — the Council looked after its own."
