L["Garrosh sent the Horde to seize whatever had been hidden in the mists. Instead, Hellscream's Fist fell burning into the Jade Forest. Nazgrim drove the survivors forward with fire and discipline, but the first victory curdled quickly. Taran Zhu named the consequence of the Horde's fury: sha. The Horde regrouped at Honeydew Village, pulled its scattered officers out of danger, and learned that Pandaria would answer violence with something far older than either faction expected."] = "Garrosh sent the Horde to seize whatever had been hidden in the mists. Instead, Hellscream's Fist fell burning into the Jade Forest. Nazgrim drove the survivors forward with fire and discipline, but the first victory curdled quickly. Taran Zhu named the consequence of the Horde's fury: sha. The Horde regrouped at Honeydew Village, pulled its scattered officers out of danger, and learned that Pandaria would answer violence with something far older than either faction expected."
