L["King Varian's command sent you after the missing White Pawn: Prince Anduin Wrynn. The Skyfire found Pandaria and immediately found the Horde. Admiral Rogers turned the gunship into a weapon, Sully McLeary got you onto the ground, and Paw'don Village became the Alliance's first real foothold. Every step inland was paid for in smoke, wounded soldiers, stolen supplies, and the first glimpse of sha born from the armies' violence. By the time Ga'trul fell at Twinspire Keep, the Alliance had survived its landing - but Taylor and Anduin were still missing."] = "King Varian's command sent you after the missing White Pawn: Prince Anduin Wrynn. The Skyfire found Pandaria and immediately found the Horde. Admiral Rogers turned the gunship into a weapon, Sully McLeary got you onto the ground, and Paw'don Village became the Alliance's first real foothold. Every step inland was paid for in smoke, wounded soldiers, stolen supplies, and the first glimpse of sha born from the armies' violence. By the time Ga'trul fell at Twinspire Keep, the Alliance had survived its landing - but Taylor and Anduin were still missing."
