L["Ritssyn Flamescowl appeared in Dalaran with a proposition — the Council of the Black Harvest needed a sixth member, and you had been chosen. The Council operated from Dreadscar Rift, a pocket of the Twisting Nether they had ripped from demonic control and claimed as their own. You proved your worth, claimed an artifact weapon steeped in dark power, and took your seat on the Council. Calydus — a demon bound to serve the warlocks — helped establish the Rift as your base of operations."] = "Ritssyn Flamescowl appeared in Dalaran with a proposition — the Council of the Black Harvest needed a sixth member, and you had been chosen. The Council operated from Dreadscar Rift, a pocket of the Twisting Nether they had ripped from demonic control and claimed as their own. You proved your worth, claimed an artifact weapon steeped in dark power, and took your seat on the Council. Calydus — a demon bound to serve the warlocks — helped establish the Rift as your base of operations."
