L["Sinfall gave the rebels a foothold, but they still needed their prince. In the ruins of his first rebellion, you found what Denathrius had left behind: cages, broken allies, and Renathal himself, imprisoned as an example. With Theotar, the Accuser, and General Draven at your side, you tore open the prison, stole the key, and pulled Renathal back from Torghast's shadow. The prince returned humbled but unbroken. He had lost a rebellion once. This time, he would not stand alone."] = "Sinfall gave the rebels a foothold, but they still needed their prince. In the ruins of his first rebellion, you found what Denathrius had left behind: cages, broken allies, and Renathal himself, imprisoned as an example. With Theotar, the Accuser, and General Draven at your side, you tore open the prison, stole the key, and pulled Renathal back from Torghast's shadow. The prince returned humbled but unbroken. He had lost a rebellion once. This time, he would not stand alone."
