L["Subtlety had its limits in Nazmir. Patch — a goblin with strong opinions about explosives and personal safety — had a solution for the blood troll barricades that was loud, expensive, and effective. You wrangled his scattered crew, gathered everything they needed, and let them do what goblins do best. The blood troll fortifications that had blocked the advance for weeks turned to rubble in an afternoon. Talanji watched the smoke rise with something close to satisfaction. The path deeper into Nazmir was open."] = "Subtlety had its limits in Nazmir. Patch — a goblin with strong opinions about explosives and personal safety — had a solution for the blood troll barricades that was loud, expensive, and effective. You wrangled his scattered crew, gathered everything they needed, and let them do what goblins do best. The blood troll fortifications that had blocked the advance for weeks turned to rubble in an afternoon. Talanji watched the smoke rise with something close to satisfaction. The path deeper into Nazmir was open."
