L["Thassarian came with a personal request — Koltira Deathweaver, his old friend and fellow death knight, had been imprisoned beneath the Undercity by Sylvanas Windrunner. You freed Koltira from his chains, and he pledged himself to your cause. Then came the steeds — Salanar the Horseman forged deathchargers in Neltharion's Lair and the Darkheart Thicket, crafting mounts worthy of the Horsemen from nightmares and shadow."] = "Thassarian came with a personal request — Koltira Deathweaver, his old friend and fellow death knight, had been imprisoned beneath the Undercity by Sylvanas Windrunner. You freed Koltira from his chains, and he pledged himself to your cause. Then came the steeds — Salanar the Horseman forged deathchargers in Neltharion's Lair and the Darkheart Thicket, crafting mounts worthy of the Horsemen from nightmares and shadow."
