L["The dreadlord Kathra'natir had been one step ahead all along — and his final move was possessing Meryl Felstorm himself. With the Tirisgarde's founder corrupted from within, Khadgar rallied every resource: a magical affliction cured in the Eye of Azshara, the might of the Tirisgarde focused into a single strike. You stormed the Oculus and faced Kathra'natir in Meryl's body, tearing the demon free without destroying the mage. Meryl stood free, Vargoth was rescued, and your weapon was reforged. The Kirin Tor bestowed upon you the title of Archmage."] = "The dreadlord Kathra'natir had been one step ahead all along — and his final move was possessing Meryl Felstorm himself. With the Tirisgarde's founder corrupted from within, Khadgar rallied every resource: a magical affliction cured in the Eye of Azshara, the might of the Tirisgarde focused into a single strike. You stormed the Oculus and faced Kathra'natir in Meryl's body, tearing the demon free without destroying the mage. Meryl stood free, Vargoth was rescued, and your weapon was reforged. The Kirin Tor bestowed upon you the title of Archmage."
