L["The Fangs of Ashamane — twin daggers blessed by the wild god of the hunt — had been lost in the wilds of Val'sharah. You tracked them through ancient feral grounds, facing guardians left by Ashamane herself. When you grasped the Fangs, the spirit of the great cat surged through you, and the wilds themselves seemed to sharpen around your senses."] = "The Fangs of Ashamane — twin daggers blessed by the wild god of the hunt — had been lost in the wilds of Val'sharah. You tracked them through ancient feral grounds, facing guardians left by Ashamane herself. When you grasped the Fangs, the spirit of the great cat surged through you, and the wilds themselves seemed to sharpen around your senses."
