L["The Legion's grip on Faronaar in Azsuna was tightening. Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker dispatched you to break it. With Vindicator Boros at your side, you cut through demon ranks and destroyed their communication orbs. Justicar Julia Celeste fought with a fury that earned her a place among your champions. The Codex of Command — a Legion tactical manual — was recovered from the battlefield, but its contents were locked behind demonic encryption."] = "The Legion's grip on Faronaar in Azsuna was tightening. Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker dispatched you to break it. With Vindicator Boros at your side, you cut through demon ranks and destroyed their communication orbs. Justicar Julia Celeste fought with a fury that earned her a place among your champions. The Codex of Command — a Legion tactical manual — was recovered from the battlefield, but its contents were locked behind demonic encryption."
