L["The Lich King's voice echoed through Acherus, pointing you toward Apocalypse — a blade of pure death forged in an age of darkness. You followed the trail through Duskwood alongside Revil Kost, hunting the Dark Riders who had stolen the sword. In the depths of Deadwind Pass, you wrested Apocalypse from their skeletal grip. The blade hummed with necrotic power, eager to fulfill the promise of its name."] = "The Lich King's voice echoed through Acherus, pointing you toward Apocalypse — a blade of pure death forged in an age of darkness. You followed the trail through Duskwood alongside Revil Kost, hunting the Dark Riders who had stolen the sword. In the depths of Deadwind Pass, you wrested Apocalypse from their skeletal grip. The blade hummed with necrotic power, eager to fulfill the promise of its name."
