L["The voice in the dark has a name now — Matthias Lehner. He claims to know the Lich King better than any living thing should. His memories run like a buried river through the Frozen Wastes. He leads you to a dragon's corpse. To a hunter and a prince. To the knowledge that cannot be unknown. Whether he can be trusted is a judgement you will make when the road ends — at the foot of the citadel, where Tirion Fordring lifts the Ashbringer and calls for one more charge."] = "The voice in the dark has a name now — Matthias Lehner. He claims to know the Lich King better than any living thing should. His memories run like a buried river through the Frozen Wastes. He leads you to a dragon's corpse. To a hunter and a prince. To the knowledge that cannot be unknown. Whether he can be trusted is a judgement you will make when the road ends — at the foot of the citadel, where Tirion Fordring lifts the Ashbringer and calls for one more charge."
