L["Thomas Zelling was a dying tidesage who traded his humanity for undeath, desperate for a few more years with his family. You and Lilian performed the ritual that raised him — and then watched his wife recoil in horror from the husband she no longer recognized. Lilian stood in silence as the scene played out, seeing her own story reflected in Zelling's shattered face. To be Forsaken, she finally understood, was not just a curse of the body."] = "Thomas Zelling was a dying tidesage who traded his humanity for undeath, desperate for a few more years with his family. You and Lilian performed the ritual that raised him — and then watched his wife recoil in horror from the husband she no longer recognized. Lilian stood in silence as the scene played out, seeing her own story reflected in Zelling's shattered face. To be Forsaken, she finally understood, was not just a curse of the body."
