L["Tiragarde Sound was rotting at its foundations. Priscilla Ashvane and the Ashvane Trading Company had corrupted the Admiralty's supply lines, bribed its officers, and turned institutional loyalty into a private racket — all while Katherine Proudmoore remained in the dark, managing the public appearances of a nation that was quietly being hollowed out beneath her. You dismantled the operation piece by piece, surfacing the evidence until the case against Ashvane was undeniable. Katherine met with Genn Greymane in Boralus Harbor. She still had not spoken to Jaina."] = "Tiragarde Sound was rotting at its foundations. Priscilla Ashvane and the Ashvane Trading Company had corrupted the Admiralty's supply lines, bribed its officers, and turned institutional loyalty into a private racket — all while Katherine Proudmoore remained in the dark, managing the public appearances of a nation that was quietly being hollowed out beneath her. You dismantled the operation piece by piece, surfacing the evidence until the case against Ashvane was undeniable. Katherine met with Genn Greymane in Boralus Harbor. She still had not spoken to Jaina."
