L["Walk the long road that turned Prince Arthas Menethil into the Lich King, and the longer road taken by those who march north to face him. It begins in Stratholme, where a prince makes an unforgivable choice in the name of salvation.\n\nBetween that memory and Icecrown lie the dragon-haunted plains of Dragonblight, the howling reach of Northrend, and a campaign waged in the long shadow of Frostmourne."] = "Walk the long road that turned Prince Arthas Menethil into the Lich King, and the longer road taken by those who march north to face him. It begins in Stratholme, where a prince makes an unforgivable choice in the name of salvation.\n\nBetween that memory and Icecrown lie the dragon-haunted plains of Dragonblight, the howling reach of Northrend, and a campaign waged in the long shadow of Frostmourne."
