L["Breaking the Stones of Binding turned battle into mercy. One by one, the servants of Razelikh, Grol, Allistarj, and Sevine lost their anchors, and the dead soldiers were released from a fate worse than death. Corporal Thund Splithoof appeared long enough to honor the work and leave a token behind. Then one name remained: Lieutenant Kirith. Finding him in the Serpent's Coil revealed the next truth. Razelikh could not be reached until his protections were understood."] = "Breaking the Stones of Binding turned battle into mercy. One by one, the servants of Razelikh, Grol, Allistarj, and Sevine lost their anchors, and the dead soldiers were released from a fate worse than death. Corporal Thund Splithoof appeared long enough to honor the work and leave a token behind. Then one name remained: Lieutenant Kirith. Finding him in the Serpent's Coil revealed the next truth. Razelikh could not be reached until his protections were understood."
