L["Jaina and Anduin brought the Alliance's hammer down on Lordaeron. The Horde fought from the walls, but the siege was overwhelming. When the gates could no longer hold, Sylvanas triggered the plague systems beneath the city — releasing the Blight on her own capital rather than let the Alliance take it. Soldiers on both sides choked and died. The Undercity was lost, left poisoned and empty behind her. The Forsaken had no home left. Again."] = "Jaina and Anduin brought the Alliance's hammer down on Lordaeron. The Horde fought from the walls, but the siege was overwhelming. When the gates could no longer hold, Sylvanas triggered the plague systems beneath the city — releasing the Blight on her own capital rather than let the Alliance take it. Soldiers on both sides choked and died. The Undercity was lost, left poisoned and empty behind her. The Forsaken had no home left. Again."
