L["At the Ruby Lifeshrine, Veritistrasz asks for something rare in an adventurer's life: time. No army waits, no world-ending machine is counting down, and no one needs a hundred trophies from the local wildlife.\n\nSit with an old red dragon in dwarf form, listen to what he remembers, and help him face the name he has spent ages trying not to say."] = "At the Ruby Lifeshrine, Veritistrasz asks for something rare in an adventurer's life: time. No army waits, no world-ending machine is counting down, and no one needs a hundred trophies from the local wildlife.\n\nSit with an old red dragon in dwarf form, listen to what he remembers, and help him face the name he has spent ages trying not to say."
