L["Dr. Hieronymus Blam was exactly the kind of scientist Rhea needed: brilliant, excitable, and only partly reassuring. His work sent you through trogg trouble, dusty titan ruins, and faction rivalries at Dustwind Dig or Bloodwatcher Point. Stone watchers, ancient games, and old machinery all became part of the same desperate experiment.\n\nEverything pointed back to one thing: a hidden clutch that Deathwing could not be allowed to find."] = "Dr. Hieronymus Blam was exactly the kind of scientist Rhea needed: brilliant, excitable, and only partly reassuring. His work sent you through trogg trouble, dusty titan ruins, and faction rivalries at Dustwind Dig or Bloodwatcher Point. Stone watchers, ancient games, and old machinery all became part of the same desperate experiment.\n\nEverything pointed back to one thing: a hidden clutch that Deathwing could not be allowed to find."
