L["After the tragedy of Rhea's story, the Badlands gave you its strangest form of grief relief: three locals trying to outdo each other with increasingly impossible versions of the day Deathwing came. Theldurin punched the Destroyer. Lucien improved the story. Martek improved it even more.\n\nNone of it was reliable history. All of it was Badlands truth: when the world breaks, sometimes people survive by turning terror into a story they can laugh at."] = "After the tragedy of Rhea's story, the Badlands gave you its strangest form of grief relief: three locals trying to outdo each other with increasingly impossible versions of the day Deathwing came. Theldurin punched the Destroyer. Lucien improved the story. Martek improved it even more.\n\nNone of it was reliable history. All of it was Badlands truth: when the world breaks, sometimes people survive by turning terror into a story they can laugh at."
