L["Kalecgos called you to the Veiled Ossuary to help tend the memories of the blue dragonflight. With Senegos and Azuregos drawn into the work, the archives became more than a vault. They became a place to face what the blues had survived: Malygos, Sindragosa, exile, war, and the long habit of grieving separately.\n\nBy the time the first memories returned, Kalecgos understood the real task. The flight could not be restored by duty alone. The missing blues had to be found, heard, and invited home."] = "Kalecgos called you to the Veiled Ossuary to help tend the memories of the blue dragonflight. With Senegos and Azuregos drawn into the work, the archives became more than a vault. They became a place to face what the blues had survived: Malygos, Sindragosa, exile, war, and the long habit of grieving separately.\n\nBy the time the first memories returned, Kalecgos understood the real task. The flight could not be restored by duty alone. The missing blues had to be found, heard, and invited home."
