L["The archives gave Kalecgos names, but names were not enough. The missing blues had built separate lives, separate loyalties, and separate ways of surviving. Some were hiding from pain. Some were trapped in old debts. Some had made peace with never returning.\n\nKalecgos chose to ask rather than command. The blue dragonflight's renewal would be a gathering, not a summons."] = "The archives gave Kalecgos names, but names were not enough. The missing blues had built separate lives, separate loyalties, and separate ways of surviving. Some were hiding from pain. Some were trapped in old debts. Some had made peace with never returning.\n\nKalecgos chose to ask rather than command. The blue dragonflight's renewal would be a gathering, not a summons."
