L["Zeros did not need a grand speech. He needed out of debt. Booty Bay wrapped the search in ledgers, bribes, crystals, and the kind of bargaining that makes dragons wonder why mortals invented money.\n\nSenegos treated the mess with surprising patience, and Zeros eventually found a path back that did not involve running forever. Even the ridiculous errands served the larger truth: every scattered blue had a different reason to stay away."] = "Zeros did not need a grand speech. He needed out of debt. Booty Bay wrapped the search in ledgers, bribes, crystals, and the kind of bargaining that makes dragons wonder why mortals invented money.\n\nSenegos treated the mess with surprising patience, and Zeros eventually found a path back that did not involve running forever. Even the ridiculous errands served the larger truth: every scattered blue had a different reason to stay away."
